      "text": "The handling of and response to communications received at City Hall constitutes one of the major functions of the Mayor's Office. In order that appropriate attention be given all communications, from ordinary or prominent citizens, or- ganizations and official bodies, I am vesting new authority and authorizing the provision of personnel and equipment as follows:",
