      "text": "As Special Assistant to the Mayor, Mrs. Ruth Farbman, in addition to special projects assigned by the Mayor, will, ef- fective immediately, assume the supervision, direction and co- ordination of all activities in connection with the communica- tions described in Executive Memorandum #87.",
